Khardoff.wikitext:
{{CSMPortal}}
{{TzeentchPortal}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a [[Tzeentch]] [[Chaos Lord|Warlord]] who plundered the minor [[Imperium]] [[Forge World]] [[Rho-Delpha]] and claimed many of its [[battle tank]]s for his own forces. He would later use them in Tzeentch's [[Invasion of the Stygius Sector]], and the Warlord personally invaded the [[Sector]]'s [[Dhobash System]]. The [[Stygius Crusade]] attempted to save the embattled Sector and Khardoff's forces clashed with the [[Space Wolves]] on the [[Agri World]] [[Dawn]]. The Space Wolves proved to be no match for the Warlord's stolen battle tanks and [[Daemon Engines]] though and would have met their end, had Imperial reinforcements not arrived to aid them. In what became the largest armour battle of the Stygius invasion, Khardoff's forces clashed with the combined might of the Space Wolves, [[Dark Angels]], [[Angels of Redemption]] and the [[Knight]]s of [[House Mundast]]. For three days the battle raged, until the Warlord's forces were defeated and Khardoff was forced to escape from the Agri World.{{Fn|1}}

