{{WorldEatersPortal}}
'''Kharneth''' was a [[World Eaters]] [[Despoiler Marine]] active during the [[Horus Heresy]].{{Fn|1}}

==Biography==
[[File:Kharneth.jpg|thumb|right|250px|'''Kharneth'''{{Fn|1}}]]
He adopted his name after the XII Legion had sworn allegiance to Horus. This designation seems to have been a dedication to the protector with whom the individual had sworn a pact.{{Fn|1}}

Kharneth fought the [[White Scars]] at the Temple of [[Ghal-Zammad]] on the world of [[Deitus]]. Despite suffering massive, debilitating gunshot wounds, he seemed possessed by rage and fury, pushing his body beyond even the expectations of Space Marine physiology. Such persistent aggression necessitated the warrior's execution by decapitation.{{Fn|1}}

