Kharrack.wikitext:
{{IronWarriorsPortal}}
'''Kharrack''' is an [[Iron Warriors]] [[Warsmith]] who took part in the [[War of Beasts]] on [[Vigilus]].{{Fn|1}}

Before the War began, he and the other Warsmiths had their plans to assault the world heavily planned out, after they had extensively studied pict-captures of Viglus' surface. However, once the Warsmiths became aware that their hated enemies of the [[Imperial Fists]], were protecting the '''Mortwald''' [[Hive]]-sprawl, the Iron Warriors disregarded their plans and launched a full-on attack on Mortwald. The Hive-sprawl was protected by [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] [[Dravastis Fane]]'s Imperial Fists forces, but they and the other [[Imperial]] defenders of Mortwald, had already been heavily ravaged fending off numerous [[Xenos]] attacks. When the Iron Warriors and their [[Flawless Host]] allies invaded Mortwald, the Imperial forces were no match for them and they retreated, leaving the Hive-sprawl in the [[Chaos Space Marines]]' hands.{{Fn|1}}

