Khepra.wikitext:
{{AdeptusMechanicusPortal}}
[[Image:Khepra.jpg|thumb|right|220px|Khepra{{Fn|1}}]]
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a [[Skitarii]] and Subdomina to [[Magos Dominus]] [[Faustinius]] aboard the [[Ark Mechanicus]] vessel, the ''[[Caestus Metalican]]''.{{Fn|2}}

As Subdomina, she has a commanding role of the numerous Skitarii troops and is keen to assure their safety. Many of her Skitarii are sent planetside on the [[Necron]] [[Tomb World]] of [[Silva Tenebris]] to execute Faustinius's mission on the world.{{Fn|2}}

Khepra is a [[Master of Skitarii]], answering to [[Faustinius]]. She serves as his military advisor as well as being in personal command of the mission's Skitarii troops. She is tough and plain-spoken, while very aware of her place in the chain of command.{{Fn|1}}

Khepra is a military officer rather than a [[Tech-Priest]] so she provides a more 'human' outlook compared to the Tech-Priests. Faustinius finds her alternative outlook refreshing, and is always impressed by her concern for the wellbeing of her troops which is something Faustinius feels he is in danger of losing. He respects Khepra, even if the other Tech-Priests do not, and usually accepts her advice on military matters.{{Fn|1}}

