Khethos Vorsch.wikitext:
{{ThousandSonsPortal}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is an [[Exalted Sorcerer]] of the [[Thousand Sons]].{{Fn|1}}

Vorsch specializes in binding sorcery, both to entrap supernatural entities and also the entanglement of one place to another. Styling himself as a puppet master of realities and an esoteric scholar, he delights in imposing his  will upon those around him. He eventually drew the attention of [[Ahriman]], who has cultivated Vorsch as an apprentice in his attempt to enter the [[Black Library of Chaos]].{{Fn|1}}

In [[M42]] Vorsch was drawn to the world of [[Mordian]] by a rhythmic shiver only his kind can feel. He has since descended to the world and raised hidden gateways and sorcerous menhirs.{{Fn|1}} Aided by Ahriman's proxy dubbed [[The Vessel]], Vorsch was successful in shattering the [[Webway]] above Mordian and bringing the realm of [[Shaa-Dom]] over the world. Vorsch and the Vessel then stepped through the new Webway portal.{{Fn|2}}

