{{BloodAngelsPortal}}
'''Khitas Frome''' was a [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] of the [[Blood Angels]] [[Legion]] during the [[Great Crusade]].{{Fn|1}}

== History ==
As leader of the '''140th [[Expedition Fleet]]''', Frome led the initial compliance action on [[One-Forty Twenty]], the twentieth planet encountered by the fleet since its inception.{{Fn|1}} The Blood Angels were overwhelmed by the [[Megarachnid]]s inhabiting the planet.{{Cite This}}

