{{BlackLegionPortal}}
'''Kholesh Gertz''' was a [[Black Legion]] [[Chaos Lord|Warlord]], whose [[Chaos Warband|Warband]] was once allied with the [[Dreadblade Knight]] [[Damas Ghoryl]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
However [[Damas Ghoryl|Ghoryl]] despises inactivity, worthless posturing and superfluous greed, which she ruthlessly stamps out without pause. This led to the ending of their alliance, during a battle with the [[Salamanders]], when Gertz began shouting an elaborated challenge to his opposing commander. Ghoryl contemptuously crushed the Warlord beneath one of her [[Dreadblade]]'s feet in response and then killed the Salamanders' commander with a battle-canon shell. Afterwards, she took command of Gertz's [[Chaos Warband|Warband]] and led them in tearing open the '''Gates of Fundas Bragantis''', which the Salamanders had been defending.{{Fn|1}}  

