{{DeathGuardPortal}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is an [[Apothecary]] of the [[Death Guard]].{{Fn|1a}}

Formerly a member of [[Calas Typhon]]'s [[Grave Warden]]s, Sinj eventually defected and joined the [[Consortium]] of [[Fabius Bile]]. Sinj wears a decayed and diseased suit of [[Cataphractii Terminator Armour]], and despite being little-liked by Fabius performed one of his brain transfers into a new clone body. Sinj is said to be one of the last Apothecaries of the Death Guard, for the followers of [[Nurgle]] require little medical attention.{{Fn|1a}}

Sinj keeps a hulking beast with him nearly at all times known as '''Paz'uz'''. Despite its hideous appearance and ability to secrete deadly acid{{Fn|1b}}, Paz'uz enjoys playing and serves as both Sinj's guardian and pet.{{Fn|1a}}

