[[Image:Khorius Rex.png|thumb|right|200px|{{PAGENAME}}{{Fn|1}}]]
'''Khorius Rex''' was a [[Legionary]] of the [[Iron Warriors]] active during the [[Great Crusade]] and [[Horus Heresy]].{{Fn|1}}

==Biography==
In his service during the Great Crusade, Khorius visited over a hundred worlds, eventually becoming a member of the [[Tyranthikos]].{{Fn|1}}

At the end of the Crusade, he was among the Iron Warriors who returned to the [[Space Marine Legion|Legion's]] [[Adeptus Astartes Homeworld|homeworld]], [[Olympia]], in order to crush the rebellion that had engulfed it.{{Fn|1}}

As part of the [[Third Grand Company]], Khorius later fought in the [[Dropsite Massacre]] on [[Isstvan V]]. He was left behind on Isstvan V when the bulk of the Legion was deployed to support [[Warmaster]] [[Horus]]. His final fate is unknown.{{Fn|1}}

