Khotus Meffiel.wikitext:
{{BloodAngelsPortal}}
'''Khotus Meffiel''' was a member of the [[Blood Angels]] [[Space Marine Legion|Legion]], who was among its forces that took part in the [[Siege of Terra]].{{Fn|1}}

Near the end of the Siege, he fought to defend the [[Imperial Palace]]'s [[Sanctum Imperialis]], but was among the [[Imperium]]'s forces left stranded after the closing of the [[Eternity Gate (Imperial)|Eternity Gate]]. Now having no means to escape or receive reinforcements, the remaining Imperials fought on against hordes of [[Traitor Legion]]s, [[Heretics]], [[Mutant]]s and [[Daemons]]. During these battles, Meffiel stood beside [[Zhintas Khan]] of the [[White Scars]], and together they destroyed a [[Sons of Horus]] [[Chaos Dreadnought|Dreadnought]]. Afterwards, the Blood Angel said the Imperials left defending the Imperial Palace outside of the Eternity Gate had become [[Life-Seller]]s: their only remaining goal now was to sell their lives dearly and see how many Traitors they could kill before death claimed them. The two later separated, but the term and Meffiel's words had a great effect on Zhintas. It filled him with pride and zeal, which caused the [[Space Marine Captain|Khan]] to vow to claim a higher kill tally, before he met his end.{{Fn|1}}

