Klaus Luther.wikitext:
{{BlackTemplarsPortal}}
'''Klaus Luther''' was a [[Black Templars]] [[Master of Sanctity]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
After his victory against [[Aeldari]] raiders on [[Verdant Secondus]], Luther was approached by [[High Marshal (Black Templars)|High Marshal]] [[Helbrecht]] himself and tasked with taking part in the [[Dark Crusade (Imperium)|Dark Crusade]]'s{{Fn|1}} [[Gathrog Campaign]].{{Fn|2}} The [[Master of Sanctity]] was then given command of the [[Galatian Crusade]] by the High Marshal and ordered to enter a [[Sector]] invaded by the [[Orks]] of the [[Green Kroosade]]. Once there, Luther was to hunt down one of their [[Boss]]es, who was sacrificing [[Imperial]] citizens to the [[Xenos]]' [[Gork and Mork|Gods]]. Luther did so, but he was later killed in battle with the Orks.{{Fn|1}}
