Kline.wikitext:
{{otheruses|USE=[[traitor]]ous PDF officer|OTHERUSE=[[General]]|OTHERPAGE=Kline (General)}}
Lord '''Kline''' was an officer of the [[Planetary Defence Forces|planetary militia]] of [[Quintus]].{{Fn|1a}}

==Biography==
When Quintus was subjugated by an [[Alpha Legion]] warband led by the [[Daemon Prince]] [[Kernax Voldorius]], Kline was amongst those in the Quintus PDF to surrender to the [[Chaos Space Marine|Traitor Marines]] and abandon the [[Imperium]] in favour of serving Voldorius.{{Fn|1a}} Kline was responsible for mustering the militia forces stationed in the capital city, [[Mankarra]].{{Fn|1b}}

Later, the 3rd Companies of the [[White Scars]] and [[Raven Guard]] arrived to [[Hunt for Voldorius|liberate Quintus]]. In the aftermath of the [[Space Marines]]' successful initial assault on Mankarra, Voldorius's militia officers turned on each other, trying to deflect the blame for the incident. Kline and [[Lord Colonel]] [[Morkis]] were the last officers to die; Kline was able to strangle Morkis, but Morkis's death-spasms were sufficient to pull the trigger of his [[laspistol]] and kill Kline in turn.{{Fn|1b}}

==Sources==
