Klord Empion.wikitext:
{{UltramarinesPortal}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}'''{{Fn|2}} was the [[Chapter Master]] of the [[Ultramarines]]' [[9th Chapter (Ultramarines Legion)|9th Chapter]] during the [[Great Crusade]] and [[Horus Heresy]].{{Fn|1}}{{Fn|2}}

==Biography==
Empion led the 9th Chapter in the [[Battle of Thoas]].{{Fn|2}}

By the time of the [[Ghaslakh Crusade]] muster, Empion was the youngest of the Legion's Chapter Masters present at the assembly on [[Calth]]. He ended up leading his chapter in the subsequent [[Battle of Calth]]. Stationed on the ''[[Macragge's Honour]]'' when it was disabled, Empion fought alongside [[Roboute Guilliman]] and [[Marius Gage]] in repelling the [[Word Bearers]] [[daemon]]ic assault.{{Fn|1}}

