Klovis the Redeemer.wikitext:
{{NecromundaPortal}}{{otheruses|USE=character|OTHERUSE=graphic novel|OTHERPAGE=The Redeemer (Graphic Novel)}}
'''Klovis the Redeemer''' (often referred to simply as "The Redeemer") is a particularly fanatical and homicidal [[Redemptionist]] from the [[Hive World]] of [[Necromunda (planet) |Necromunda]].{{Fn|1}}

==Overview==
[[Image:KlovisArt.jpg|thumb|right|200px|{{PAGENAME}}{{Fn|3}}]]
Klovis is a noble of [[House Cawdor]], based in [[Hive Primus]]. He has led a band of zealous followers throughout the [[Underhive]] and out into the [[Ash Wastes (Necromunda)|Ash Wastes]] with the aim of spreading his beliefs among the area's outcast inhabitants.{{Fn|1}}

Among his band are faithful [[Deacon]] [[Malakev]], who carries a book of tortures called the ''[[Liber Excruciatus]]'', and [[Brude]], a cowardly [[Ratskin]].{{Fn|1}}

The Redeemer wears a flaming crown and fights with an [[eviscerator]] that he calls the ''"[[Sword of Persecution]]"''. He travels around in a vehicle known as the ''[[Pulpitek]]'' - an armoured car equipped with [[auto-cannon]]s.{{Fn|1}}

The Redeemer and his band battle various foes including Ratskins, [[Scavvies]], [[Plague Zombies]] and other Underhive scum in a revolution against the [[noble]]s of the [[Hive Spire|Spire]].{{Fn|1}}

