Knosso Prond.wikitext:
{{ImperiumPortal}}

'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a [[Death Cult Assassin]]{{Fn|1}} who serves the [[Rogue Trader]] [[Elucia Vhane]].

For a [[Death Cult]] '''Executioner''', the act of living is a blasphemy only balanced by the tally of souls they reap. They deliver death up close and master numerous combat styles. A follower of [[Elucia Vhane]], the [[Death Cult]] '''Executioner''' '''Knosso Prond''' has voved to kill a thousand different xenos.{{Fn|4}}

Hailing from the [[Winged Skull]] Death Cult, Prond was forced by the political manoeuvrings of her priestess to take a vow to strike out into the [[galaxy]], unable to speak a word or return to her temple until she had slain a specimen from 1,000 [[xenos]] races. This made joining Vhane's [[Elucidian Starstriders]], which journeys into new frontiers of space, a natural option to achieve this goal. Though silent, Prond is loyal to Vhane and acts as her champion.{{Fn|3}}

When the [[Chaos God]] [[Nurgle|Nurgle's]] [[Gellerpox]] plague struck Elucia's vessel, the ''[[New Dawn]]'', Prond was one of the few who were left uninfected and now fights besides them to escape from the [[Mutant]] hordes the plague has created.{{Fn|2}}

