Ko-Zun.wikitext:
{{CSMPortal}}
'''Ko-Zun''' is a [[Chaplain]] in the [[Jade Talons]] [[Chaos Space Marine Chapter]].{{Fn|1b}}
==History==
He was amongst the [[Jade Talons]] that survived{{Fn|1b}} the [[War of the False Primarch]], after they were declared [[Traitoris Perdita]]. However, they had been left shattered by the [[Imperium]]{{Fn|1a}} and Ko-Zun was subsequently amongst the Jade Talons{{Fn|1b}} that followed their [[Chapter Master]], [[Sah'Al-Zhar]] into [[Heresy]]. This allowed the survivors to be reborn as a [[Chaos Space Marine Chapter]]{{Fn|1c}} and while Ko-Zun is still a [[Chaplain]], he now welds a [[Chaos Havoc]] [[Power Maul]].{{Fn|1b}}
==Trivia==
{{Trivia}}
''Ko-Zun'', [[Sah'Al-Zhar]] and the [[Jade Talons]] were created{{Fn|1b}} by '''Adam Staincliffe'''.{{Fn|1a}} They appeared in [[White Dwarf 515]].{{Fn|1b}}

