Kobal Ru'than.wikitext:
{{SalamandersPortal}}
[[Image:Kobal Ru'than.jpeg|thumb|right|275px|{{PAGENAME}}]]
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' , known as the True Blade , was an [[Exterminator]] of the personal escort of Lord Protector Da'Ru of the Kingdom of Themis. Chosen among the best warriors and craftsmen their companies could offer , the personal escorts of the Protector Lords were the embodiment of the principles of the Prometheus Cult . These indomitable warriors won many honours, and victories are reflected in the decoration  of Ru'than's armour (ex, in the glyphs of his left greave).In the final hours of the Massacre on [[Istvaan V]] , Lord Protector Da'Ru ordered his phalanx of escorts, including Ru'than, to form around him and lead a charge against the heaviest concentration of enemies. Later fragments of the distinctive armor of Kobal Ru'than was used like trophies and adornments by the [[Night Lords]] Armoured units. {{Fn|1}}

