Kol Rakhul.wikitext:
{{NightLordsPortal}}
'''Kol Rakhul''' is a [[Night Lords]] [[Chaos Lord|Warlord]], who is known as the '''Death of Saints'''.{{Fn|1}} 
==History==
He is an almost legendary figure within the history of the [[Adepta Sororitas]]' [[Argent Shroud]], who has sworn to kill all of its members and destroy any trace of the [[Orders Militant]]'s existence. Rakhul held a deep grudge against the Adepta Sororitas for separating him from his sister (later revealed to have become [[Saint Athenasia]]) as a child{{Fn|2b}}. Rakhul continued his war against the [[Ecclesiarchy]], when he led the [[Night Lords]] in [[Ophelian Crusade|an invasion]] of the [[Imperial]] [[Cardinal World]] [[Ophelia VII]] in [[M42]]. The [[Abbess Sanctorum]] [[Morvenn Vahl]] would later come to the world's aid, in order to save it from the [[Chaos Lord|Warlord]]'s invasion.{{Fn|1}} Rakhul had become infatuated with the [[Penitent]] slave [[Lethe Fulmens]], and desperately sought to keep her in his control.{{Fn|2a}}

Morvenn Vahl's small expedition to Ophelia VII was successful in stopping {{PAGENAME}}'s invasion, despite a lack of support from the [[High Lords of Terra]]. Faced with defeat and having lost his precious slave Lethe, Rakhul ordered that a detonator be activated in order to destroy the whole of [[Convent Sanctorum]]. However Vahl was able to finally kill the bane of the Argent Shroud before the bombs could be activated.{{Fn|2b}}

