Konstans Pulkyria Herakloni.wikitext:
{{AdeptusCustodesPortal}}
'''Konstans Pulkyria Herakloni''' is a member of the [[Adeptus Custodes]]' [[Dread Host]] and is among its forces currently stationed aboard the [[Moiraides]] warship, '''Aetropas'''.{{Fn|1}}
==History==
They were fighting the [[World Eaters]] near the [[Eye of Terror]], when the [[Moiraides|Aetropas]]' forces learned of the [[Battle of Lion's Gate]]. The news caused them to rage, both at being unable to stop the attack on [[Terra]] and for not being there to aid in its defense. When his fellow [[Custodian]] [[Oldorian Mefistal]], declared that the Aetropas' Dread Host would now never rest from battle, Herakloni and the others readily agreed. Their war of vengeance against the [[Imperium]]'s foes so them defeat the [[Black Legion]] on [[Dakhorth]], destroy the [[Shattered Bone]] [[Chaos Warband|Warband]], banish the [[Daemon]] hordes of [[Drch'yyne'kyl]] on [[Klythes IV]] and purged the [[Orks]] from [[Lenthis]], with the aid of the [[Sisters of Silence]]. Their most recent battle, led to the destruction of the [[Dark Eldar]] on [[Bajil]], which freed the [[Xenos]]' tortured prisoners. However despite their success, Herakloni knows the war they have declared is far from over for Aetropas' Dread Host. [[Hive Fleet Leviathan]] threatens [[Segmentum Solar]], the [[Nachmund Gauntlet]] burns with war, the [[Pariah Nexus]] grows ever deeper, the [[Octarius War]] rages and the forces of [[Chaos]] still run rampant across the [[Galaxy]].{{Fn|1}}

