Konstantos.wikitext:
{{UltramarinesPortal}}
'''Konstantos''' was [[Chapter Master|Lord]] of the [[Doom Legion]] [[Chapter]] during the [[Abyssal Crusade]], where six [[Space Marine Company|Companies]] turned to [[Chaos]].{{Fn|1}}

After [[Basillius]] was cast down as a False [[Saint]], Konstantos was visited by the former [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] of the [[First Company]] [[Viktarion]] on the Star Fortress ''[[Faithful's Deliverance]]''. Viktarion had come to ask Konstantos and the remaining loyal Companies to join the newly formed [[Vectors of Pox]] [[Chaos Warband]] and reform the Chapter. Viktarion was turned away, and as he left the Star Fortress, Konstantos had the traitor's ship destroyed.{{Fn|1}}

