Kor Gurat.wikitext:
{{WordBearersPortal}}
'''Kor Gurat''' was a member of the [[Word Bearers]] [[Traitor Legion]], who took part in the [[Horus Heresy]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
After their [[Primarch]], [[Lorgar]], was banished by [[Warmaster Horus]], during the [[Horus Heresy]], Gurat was among the [[Word Bearers]] who followed him into exile. By the time the Heresy's [[Siege of Terra]] neared its end, Lorgar had led these Word Bearers to the world [[Yssimae]]. There, they were welcomed by its population and began taking part in Yssimae's many divination rituals. This was a fixation that had become the world's industry and Lorgar would pay deep attention to the Word Bearers' visions and signs, that pertained to the Siege.{{Fn|1}}

