Korbol.wikitext:
'''Korbol''' was an [[Imperial Guard]] trooper who was killed during the [[Chaos]] insurrection on [[Sepus Prime]].{{Fn|1}}

==History==
By the end of the [[Chaos]] insurrection on [[Sepus Prime]], Korbol was part of Lieutenant [[Sorov]]'s unit. While most of the regiment pushed to take the civitate, they waited to ambush insurrectionist Governor [[Narbo]]'s [[Aquila Lander]], in an attempt to fragment the insurrectionist forces. Korbol was assigned to be a lookout for the Lander.{{Fn|1}}

When the Lander appeared, they successfully shot it down. Narbo survived the crash, and transformed into a [[Chaos Spawn]], which killed the entire unit, except for [[Sorov]], [[Vox-officer]] [[Federak]], and [[Sanctioned Psyker]] [[Glutt]].{{Fn|1}}

==Trivia==
{{Trivia}}
===Notes===
*While Korbol is not specifically stated to have been killed by the [[Chaos Spawn]] that [[Narbo]] transformed into, all of [[Sorov]]'s unit were killed by it, except for Sorov, [[Federak]], and [[Glutt]].{{Fn|1}}
*Lieutenant [[Sorov]] said to his unit "you might even get off this rancid planet", implying that their regiment was not from [[Sepus Prime]].{{Fn|1}}

