'''Kordray Mordred''' was a [[Dark Angels]] [[Praetor (Rank)|Knight-Praetor]] of the [[Space Marine Legion|Legion]]'s [[Chapter|51 Chapter]], who took part in the [[Great Crusade]] and the [[Horus Heresy]].{{Fn|1b}}
