During the last years of the [[Great Crusade]], Mordred commanded the [[Space Marine Legion|Legion]]' garrison on [[Advex-Mors]]. In 006.[[M31]] this became the earliest known engagement of the [[Dark Angels]] in the [[Horus Heresy]], when the [[Sons of Horus]] [[Heavy Cruiser]] [[Conqueror's Pride]] launched a [[Treachery at Advex-Mors|surprise attack]] upon it. The [[Traitor]]s sought to claim{{Fn|1b}} the [[Rangdan Xenocides]] arsenal that the garrison was defending{{Fn|1a}}, but the [[Praetor (Rank)|Knight-Praetor]] and his forces fought fiercely to defend themselves. As they clashed, Mordred called the [[Promethean Class Cruiser]] [[Invidious]] back from patrol and it races back to Advex-Mors. It was due to the Cruiser's arrival, that the Sons of Horus were forced to retreat and thanks to the efforts of the Knight-Praetor and his forces, they were not able to steal all of the garrison's arsenal.{{Fn|1b}} 

