Korsiron.wikitext:
{{ThousandSonsPortal}}
'''Korsiron''' was a [[Thousand Sons]] [[Space Marine]] who was active during the [[Horus Heresy]]. As a [[Loyalists of the Traitor Legions|loyalist]], Korsiron led a small group of Thousand Sons that operated as part of a [[The Shattered Legions|Shattered Legions]] warband.{{Fn|1}}

==Biography==
Korsiron's rank and background are unclear, but he commanded a group of Thousand Sons survivors that joined the Shattered Legions coalition of [[Bahan Khan]] of the [[White Scars]]' [[Brotherhood of the Dying Sun]]. Eventually, Korsiron rose to Bahan Khan's co-commander alongside [[Garran Torvig]] of the [[Iron Hands]]'s [[Clan Atraxii]].{{Fn|1}}

