==History==
He is known to have taken part in the [[Uttaus Compliance]] and the [[Battle of the Eurydice Terminal]], against the [[Osirian Psybrids]]. During the [[Ultramarines]]' battle against the [[Xenos]] species, Peleos was a member of the [[7th Chapter (Ultramarines Legion)|7th Chapter]]'s [[Space Marine Company|Command Company]] and the bulk of the Chapter was deployed on the ''[[Thunder of Hera]]''. It would launch a boarding attack against one of the Psybrids' warships and Peleos fought with his Company when it deployed as part of the 7th's second wave of boarders. They moved in the wake of the Chapter's [[Terminators]] and planted charges within the warship's interior. Peleos and the Command Company's efforts would ultimately play a key role in the destruction of the boarded Psybrids' warship.{{Fn|1}}

He was later amongst the Ultramarines' forces that took part in the [[Horus Heresy]]'s [[Battle of Calth]].{{Fn|2}}

