Kratoz.wikitext:
{{IronHandsPortal}}
'''Kratoz''' was a [[Centurion (Rank)|Spearhead Centurion]] in the [[Iron Hands]] [[Space Marine Legion|Legion]], who took part in the [[Horus Heresy]].{{Fn|1}}

==Biography==
A survivor of the [[Horus Heresy|Heresy]]'s [[Dropsite Massacre]], Kratoz and his fellow [[Iron Hands]] survivor, [[Khrysaor]], fought to reach [[Terra]] afterwards. They did so seeking to serve the [[Imperium]] and claim some repudiation and vengeance, when [[Horus]]' forces invaded the world. They succeeded in doing so before the [[Siege of Terra|Siege]] began and both still lived, as the invasion neared its end.{{Fn|1}}

After the closing of the [[Eternity Gate (Imperial)|Eternity Gate]], the two would join the [[Imperial Fists]] defending the [[Imperial Palace]]'s '''Processional of the Eternals'''. When the [[World Eaters]] later neared their position, the defenders began yelling out their [[Space Marine Legion|Legion]]'s battle cries. While the words of the two Iron Hands were drowned out by the much larger Imperial Fists forces, they both heard it and that was enough. Though their Legion was [[Shattered Legions|diminished]], the Iron Hands still lived and as they prepared to fight besides their Imperial Fists Battle Brothers, the two vowed not to retreat. They would show the [[Traitor]]s that their flesh was not weak and that their deeds would endure.{{Fn|1}}

==Sources==
*{{Endn|1}}: [[The End and the Death: Volume I (Novel)]] - 1:vi

