Krijeni Luceior.wikitext:
{{SpaceMarinePortal}}
'''Krijeni Luceior''' is a [[Dark Krakens]] [[Primaris Captain]], who is currently leading its forces in the [[Octarius Sector]] against [[Hive Fleet Leviathan]].{{Fn|1}}

==History==
Originally a [[Greyshield]], Luceior fought alongside many warriors from the [[White Scars]], [[Space Wolves]], and [[Raven Guard]] and was greatly influenced by their penchant for hunting, tracking, and hanging trophies and fetishes on their armour. When the Dark Krakens were founded on [[Naktis]], he fully embraced the similar culture.{{Fn|2a}}

