Krozier Va'kai.wikitext:
{{AlphaLegionPortal}}
'''Krozier Va'kai''' is a [[Chaos Lord|Captain]] in the [[Serpent's Teeth]] [[Alpha Legion]] [[Chaos Warband|Warband]] and commands its flagship, the [[Lunar Cruiser]] [[Whisper (Lunar Cruiser)|Whisper]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
It was his skill in void warfare that earned Va'kai his position and the [[Chaos Lord|Captain]] displayed it, during the [[Serpent's Teeth]]'s invasion of the [[Imperial]] world [[Pendata (World)|Pendata]] in [[M42]]. The [[Chaos Warband|Warband]] and their [[Chaos Cult|Cult]] allies had nearly overran Pendata, when the [[Indomitus Crusade]] forces of the [[Silver Templars]] came to its aid. Three [[Strike Cruisers]] from the [[Chapter]] soon attacked the [[Whisper (Lunar Cruiser)|Whisper]], but they proved to be no match for the [[Lunar Cruiser]]. With Va'kai's skills and the fact that the Silver Templars' warships did not fight together, the Whisper was able to keep them at bay. It was then able to destroy one of the Strike Cruisers, but this led the Silver Templars warships to deploy the Chapter's forces to Pendata. Seeing what was happening, Va'kai quickly warned the Serpent's Teeth's [[Harrowmaster]], [[Drazus Jate]], that the Silver Templars were racing towards the Warband's current location.{{Fn|1}}

