Kruellagh.wikitext:
{{DrukhariPortal}}
'''Kruellagh''' is the [[Archon]] of the [[Emasculators]], a pirate warband affiliated with the [[Kabal of the Flayed Skull]].{{Fn|2}} She was first encountered by the [[Imperium|Imperium of Man]] on [[M38|6129967.M38]]. She is usually referred to as '''Kruellagh the Vile''' although she is known by many other aliases, such as "The Mistress of Skulls", "The Emasculator", "Da Skinna" (by the [[Orks]]), and "Mistress Hell Fury".{{Fn|1}}

[[File:Kruellagh.jpg|thumb|right3300px|Kruellagh the Vile{{Fn|1}}]]

==Overview==
Kruellagh is the [[Archon]] of a pirate band called [[The Emasculators]]. The warband, part of the [[Kabal of the Flayed Skull]], consists of about one hundred warriors dominated by the females, and is known for its extreme cruelty; it is feared in the [[Lestos]] and [[Thrandos]] Sectors and sought by Imperial authorities for numerous raids and atrocities.{{Fn|2}}

A tax or tithe, often in the form of slaves or souls, is required from these bands for the Lord of their Kabal, which are then refined by the [[Haemonculi]].{{Fn|2}}

==Equipment==
Kruellagh has a few pieces of equipment customized to suit her combat style and purpose.{{Fn|1}}

====Soul Flayer====
The Soul Flayer is Kruellagh's primary weapon, and the source of most stories about her. It is composed of a pair of two extremely sharp spikes that extend out from her palm. The spikes house tubes through which the victim's vital fluids are drained directly into Kruellagh, energising her, making her stronger and faster with each kill.{{Fn|1}}{{Fn|2}}

====Damnation Grenades====
Kruellagh carries a [[terrorfex]] into combat with her, along with specially crafted Damnation grenades which she occasionally uses in place of a terrorfex's primary ammunition. Damnation grenades do cause significant damage to their target, unlike the standard issue [[Terrorfex#Wraithbone Grenades|wraithbone grenades]].{{Fn|1}}{{Fn|2}}

