{{Ambig|subject=Wolf Lord|disambiguation=Kruger}}
'''Kruger''' was a [[Wolf Lord]] who fought in the [[First War of Armageddon]].{{Fn|1}}

Kruger was slain in combat with three [[Khorne Berzerker]]s, a sight which caused one of his [[Wolf Guard]]s, [[Ulrik]], to go berserk himself.  Ulrik slew all three Berzerkers even after having lost his own weapon; the [[Chaos Lord]] of the attacking [[World Eaters]] was moved to offer a salute at the [[Space Wolves|Space Wolf's]] savagery and martial skill.{{Fn|2}}

In the aftermath of the First War, Ulrik was renamed "the Slayer" and his fellow Wolf Guards voted him as Kruger's successor.  Ulrik declined, instead going on to become the [[Chapter|chapter's]] [[Wolf High Priest]].{{Fn|2}}

