'''Redemptor Kyrinov''' is a [[Confessor]] of the [[Ministorum]].

==History==
He is renowned for rooting out heresy and blasphemy from a multitude of Imperial worlds.  In his task of hounding deviants from the worlds of the Imperium and from the masses, he is as capable of fiery zealotry as he is of cold and calculating tactics.  He is a strong adherent of the teachings of Confessor [[Dolan Chirosius]], particularly his belief that no sacrifice is too great.

His notable achievements include:
*Purging the [[Chaos]] legions of the Demagogue Lord of [[Valaan]];
*Monitoring a [[Valhallan Ice Warriors]] [[Regiment]] on their [[Crusade]] of Repentance;
*Halting the Jihad of Duke [[Selda]];
*Ending the [[Molovian Heresy]] without help from the [[Imperium]].   Kyrinov led a revolt against, and eventually overthrew, the renegade [[Governor]] of [[Molov]], [[Vlachek]].

