Kyrolius (Raven Guard).wikitext:
{{RavenGuardPortal}}
'''Kyrolius''' is a [[Techmarine]] in the [[Raven Guard]] [[Chapter]]. He is also a [[Stormhawk Interceptor]] ace and '''Squadron Leader''' in [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] [[Solaro|Solaro's]] [[2nd Company (Raven Guard)|Second Company]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
When the [[Raven Guard]] received word that the [[Imperial]] world [[Fal Primus]] was invaded by the [[Ork]]s of [[Waaagh! Gutslusher]], the [[2nd Company (Raven Guard)|Second Company]] came to its defense. Kyrolius led his [[Stormhawk Interceptor]] squadron against the ferocious [[Xenos]], but the Orks were able to wipe them out. The [[Techmarine]] was left the only survivor and Kyrolius retreated back to his [[Space Marine Company|Company's]] front lines. However before he was able to reach them, Kyrolius was ambushed by the [[Wazbom Blastajet]] of [[Mekboy]] [[Badlug]]. Despite being caught by surprise, the Techmarine was soon able to use his superb skills to turn the aerial duel against the Mekboy and sent Badlug's damaged Blastajet hurtling towards the ground. Before he crashed, though, Badlug was able to aim the Blastajet at Captain Solaro's [[Space Marine Command Squad|command squad]]. The resulting explosion injured the Captain and also turned the tide of the battle against the Raven Guard.{{Fn|1}}
