Kysaduras.wikitext:
{{EldarPortal}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''', known as '''The Anchorite''', is an [[Eldar]] mystic. In 991.[[M41]], he proclaimed that the End Times of the Eldar have begun. After a lengthy meditation alongside [[Eldrad Ulthran]] of [[Ulthwe]], he preached to the High [[Farseer|Seers]] that the Eldar's only hope of survival lies with [[Ynnead]], the Eldar God of the Dead.{{Fn|1}}

During his long exile, Kysaduras journeyed far and wide. For a time, he even dwelt within the fabled [[Black Library of Chaos]]. His prior contact with the [[White Seer|White Seers]] there enabled him to forewarn them of [[Yvraine|Yvraine's]] coming when she journeyed to the Black Library seeking the [[Hand of Darkness]].{{Fn|3}}

Kysaduras later joined the [[Ynnari]], but was killed by [[Ahriman]] during the [[War in the Labyrinth]] when the [[Sorcerer]] transformed him into a wooden statue.{{Fn|2}}

