Kyublai.wikitext:
{{WhiteScarsPortal}}
'''Kyublai''' was a [[Great Khan]] of the [[White Scars]] [[Chapter]] in the [[41st millennium]].{{Fn|1}}{{Fn|2}}{{Fn|3}} He held this position for over a hundred years.{{Fn|4}}


==Biography==
During his centennial as Great Khan he commissioned the death of [[Daemon Prince]] [[Kernax Voldorius]], a great enemy of the Chapter. The task was [[Hunt for Voldorius|executed]] by [[Kor'sarro Khan]].{{Fn|4}}

In 858.M41 Kyublai lead White Scars forces in the [[Diata Purge]].{{Fn|5}}

In 943.M41 Kyublai disappeared fighting forces of the [[Dark Eldar]] of the [[Kabal of the Bloodied Talon]]. His successor [[Jubal Khan]] leads the Chapter to this day. He has left behind his weapon, the [[Glaive of Vengeance]], as a relic.{{Fn|1}}{{Fn|2}}{{Fn|3}}


==Trivia==
{{Trivia}}
*[[Wikipedia:Kublai Khan|Kublai Khan]] (also spelled ''Khubilai'') was a grandson of [[Wikipedia:Genghis Khan|Genghis Khan]], and the fifth Great Khan of the [[Wikipedia:Mongol Empire|Mongol Empire]], under whom its boundaries reached their greatest extent.

