Laerthrys.wikitext:
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is the [[Corsair Prince]] of the [[Sky Raiders]] warband.{{Fn|1}}

During the [[Battle of the Karin Nebula]], the [[Space Wolves]] under [[Bran Redmaw]] inflicted terrible losses upon the Sky Raiders as well as murdering {{PAGENAME}}' entire family. {{PAGENAME}} himself was horrifically wounded during the battle, and has vowed to slay the sons of [[Leman Russ (Primarch)|Russ]] wherever they can be found. Despite this, he is not focused solely on vengeance. Seeing so many of his kin slain brought home the reality of the [[Eldar]]'s vulnerability in the galaxy, and he now also takes care to deploy his warriors on missions to preserve and protect his people.{{Fn|1}}

