'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a [[Baron]] of [[House Krast]], who pilots the [[Knight Crusader]] ''[[Redemption of Adamant]]''.{{Fn|1}}

As a Baron, Lagos’ duties are to maintain his stronghold, to lead the Knights under his service, and to answer the call of the [[High Monarch|Princeps]] should he summon members of House Krast to war. Depending upon his liege’s needs, Baron Lagos might send a household detachment of his Knights, go into battle himself, or lead his own favoured escort – a Baronial Court – into battle.{{Fn|1}}

