==Biography==
{{Spoiler|source=[[Honour Guard (Novel)]] — [[The Saint (Omnibus)]]}}
Active during the [[Sabbat Worlds Crusade]], LeGuin was part of the honour guard assembled on [[Hagia]] that was ordered to retrieve the remains of [[Saint Sabbat]] from their [[Shrinehold of Saint Sabbat|resting place]] as part of an evacuation of [[Imperial]] forces from the planet.{{Fn|1a}}

