'''Leeta Tang''' was a historian who was a founding member of the [[Order of Interrogation]], that [[Kyril Sindermann]] formed during the [[Horus Heresy]]'s [[Battle for Terra]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
They were tasked with recording the history of the [[Battle for Terra]], even as it still raged, and were given permission to go where they wanted. Tang chose to visit the [[Imperial Palace]]'s manufactories, with the munition plants being her main focus.{{Fn|1}}  

Later during the final stages of the Siege, Tang accompanies [[Euphrati Keeler]] and other survivors in an exodus from the [[Sanctum Imperialis]], guided by a mysterious light.{{Fn|2}} The group eventually arrived at the [[Hollow Mountain]], where they faced certain death in the face of a massive [[Death Guard]] assault led by [[Typhus]]. However Keeler was able to lead a sacrificial prayer amongst the faithful throngs that caused a psychic backlash which not only threw back the Death Guard but also reactivated the [[Astronomican]]. The prayer caused many of the faithful to disintegrate into dust, Tang included.{{Fn|3}}

