Leif Hemligjaga.wikitext:
{{SpaceWolvesPortal}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' was a [[Rune Priest (Space Wolves)|Rune Priest]] of the [[Space Wolves]]' [[13th Great Company]] who emerged from the [[Eye of Terror]] during the [[13th Black Crusade]].{{Fn|1}}

==Biography==
Leif Hemligjaga was attached to Dekk-Tra, the 13th Great Company, during the [[Great Crusade]]. When two Legionaries succumbed to the [[Wulfen|Curse of the Wulfen]] in quick succession during the [[Dulan Campaign]], Leif assessed them to have been free of ''[[Chaos|maleficarum]]''. He and the [[Wolf Priest]] [[Ulbrandr Crowhame]] were tasked with finding a cure for the condition.{{Fn|2}} Like the rest of the Wolf Brothers, he disappeared after chasing the [[Thousand Sons]] into the [[warp]] in the [[Battle of Prospero]].{{Fn|3}}

During the [[13th Black Crusade]], Leif was part of a force of the 13th Great Company that emerged from the [[Eye of Terror]] led by [[Hjalmar Stormfist]]. His presence, and the fact that the Legionaries wore salvaged [[Chaos]] [[Power Armour]], provoked [[Inquisitor Lord]] [[Karamazov]] into ordering a strike force of [[Sisters of Battle]] to attack them.{{Fn|1}}

