Leinhert.wikitext:
{{BlackTemplarsPortal}}
'''Leinhert''' was the [[Emperor's Champion]] of the [[Black Templars]]' [[Vornn Crusade]].{{Fn|1}}

==History==
The ill-fated Crusade had sought to track down and slay the [[Daemon Primarch]] [[Magnus]] in [[M42]]. However it ended in failure, with Leinhert falling in battle and his [[Black Sword]] becoming lost to the [[Black Templars]]. Sometime later, though, [[Marshal (Black Templars)|Marshal]] [[Maxim (Marshal)|Maxim]] received visions from [[Emperor of Mankind|the Emperor]], which bade him to recover [[Lost Blade of Leinhert|Leinhert's lost blade]]. Maxim obeyed and has launched the [[Tanhelm Crusade]] into the [[Kerabdim Nebula]], where the visions place the relic.{{Fn|1}}

