===Trivia===
{{Trivia}}
*The [[Wikipedia: Rus' people|Rus']] were a [[Wikipedia:Norsemen|Norse]] people heavily involved in the early histories of Finland, Russia, and Ukraine. The Rus' are often portrayed as [[Wikipedia:Vikings|Vikings]] in popular culture, and likely inspired (in part) a lot of the Spaces Wolves aesthetic.  
*Leman Russ is known to be good at the strategy board game [[Hnefatafl]].{{Fn|26a}}
*Leman Russ has piercing blue eyes.{{Fn|26a}}
*After being brought into the Imperium, Leman Russ chose to keep Fenris as a Death World. Choosing to not have the planet's orbit stablised, monsters purged, and so on, in order keep be sure his Legion's recruits were tough.{{Fn|25g}}


