*When Leman Russ was introduced in [[1st Edition]], it was not as a [[Primarch]] but as a Marine Commander. Rather than being created on [[Terra]] by the [[Emperor]], he was born in 2612016.[[M32]] in the [[Guranta D Gurantan]] System. Russ was enlisted as a special agent for the [[Adeptus Terra]] at age 25 and appointed commander of [[Lucan]] the following year. He played a principal role in founding the "[[Spacewolves]]" chapter, which became based on Lucan (rather than [[Fenris]]).{{Fn|3a}}
