Lennard.wikitext:
{{ImperialNavyPortal}}
'''Lennard''' is an [[Aeronautica Imperialis]] [[Wing Commander|Wing-Commander]], who pilots a [[Lightning Strike]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
The [[Wing Commander|Wing-Commander]] was among the [[Imperial]] forces that unsuccessfully defended [[Lazulai]] from a [[Tyranid]] invasion in [[M42]]. As the world began to fall to the [[Xenos]], after months of warfare, Lennard led the [[Lightning Strikes]] stationed in '''Cobalt Fortress''', which was commanded by [[General]] [[Kvelter]]. When an overwhelming force of Tyranids began heading towards the Fortress, though, the General was given a final mission to undertake by [[Sector Command]]'s [[Lord Commander]] [[Stone (Lord Commander)|Stone]]. She was to send out a small force to find and evacuate an asset on Lazulai, before the world was consumed by the Xenos. The General gave the mission to [[Major]] [[Wulf Khan]] of the [[Catachan CMIII]], but Kvelter also sought to increase the Major's chances of success. In order to do so, the General decided to lead Lennard and the Fortress' other surviving Imperial forces in a final advance out of its walls. Their large numbers would then draw the Tyranids' attention to them and allow Major Khan's group to slip past the Xenos near the Fortress.{{Fn|1}}

