Leonis Harum.wikitext:
{{BloodAngelsPortal}}
[[File:BAMkIII.jpg|thumb|right|Leonis Harum{{Fn|1}}]]
'''Leonis Harum''' was a [[Space Marine Sergeant|Veteran Sergeant]]{{Fn|2}} from the [[202nd Company (Blood Angels Legion)|202nd Company]] of the [[Blood Angels]] [[Space Marine Legion|Legion]].{{Fn|1}}{{Fn|2}}

==Biography==
Harum was one of the few survivors of the sinking [[Heavy Cruiser]] ''[[Ifrit Nine]]''. Landing on the battlefield of [[Signus Campaign|Signus Prime]], Harum, along with the members of his company, saved the flank from defeat at the cost of their lives. He and his battle-brothers were recognized as heroes and martyrs of this battle by the Legion.{{Fn|2}}

The 202nd Company was known as one of the few units to resist the worst excesses of [[Black Rage|rage]] that affected the rest of the Legion, protecting themselves from [[The Flaw|their genetic flaw]] with the [[Liturgy of Blood]] and remaining faithful to their duty until death.{{Fn|2}}

==Equipment==
Leonis Harum wore a suit of [[MKIV]] power armour. He bore many marks of honour on his armour, including raised icons engraved on the chest and helmet depicting a citation for bravery from an [[Archein]] of the IX Legion.{{Fn|2}}

