Leontios Nikel Theodoso Galba.wikitext:
{{AdeptusCustodesPortal}}
'''Leontios Nikel Theodoso Galba''' is an [[Adeptus Custodes]] [[Adeptus Custodes#Ranks & Titles|Prefect]] of the [[Solar Watch]].{{Fn|1}}

==History==
[[Image:Leontios.jpg|thumb|right|150px|{{PAGENAME}}{{Fn|1}}]]
After joining the [[Shield Host]], Galba's first mission had him stand watch over the [[Icesteel Citadel of Umbriel]]. He then spent 23 years aboard the [[Halys Magna]], where Galba eliminated 800 infiltrators. 12 years were then spent watching over the [[Larissan Beacon]], where Galba showed his watchfulness and patience was unyielding. A century was then spent sweeping the [[Halo Belt]], uncovering weakness, discovering treachery and making the [[Emperor]]'s gaze felt upon the traitors who hid within the Belt's darkness.{{Fn|1}} 

When Galba turned 200 years old, he took part in the [[Custodes]]' [[Blood Games]], which he won after 3 years. This allowed him to take on the title of '''Shieldsmith''', but the truest prize was strengthening [[Terra]]'s defences. Afterwards, Galba undertook his first [[Talon Sortie]] with the [[Solar Watch]] against the [[Word Bearers]], whose rituals threatened Terra. Under the command of [[Shield-Captain]] [[Solomon Julianus Pertinax]], the Solar Watch were victorious and ended their threat. During the course of the battle, Galba killed many of [[Lorgar]]'s foul sons and shattered many of their hideous [[Chaos Icons]] as well. His second Talon Sortie was against [[Craftworld Eldar]], while under the command of Shield-Captain [[Gordian Hestilion]]. With the aid of the [[Sisters of Silence]], the Solar Watch's forces put an end to the [[Xenos]]' schemes against Terra. During the course of the battle, Galba was noted for killing many of the Eldar's [[Psykers]], who were weakened by the Sisters' presence.{{Fn|1}}  

His third [[Talon Sortie]] was against the [[Necrons]], while under the command of [[Shield-Captain]] [[Tacitus Karinus]]. There they launched a [[teleportation]] strike against an awakening [[Necron Tomb World]] and ensured that none of the [[Xenos]] reached its surface. For his many victories, centuries of service, diligence and honour, Galba was later made a [[Custodian]] [[Adeptus Custodes#Ranks & Titles|Prefect]]. The Custodian who then put Galba's deeds to record, hoped that those that served the [[Solar Watch]] would follow the Prefect's example. He also aspired to serve the [[Shield Host]] with the same selflessness, skill and courage, that Galba displayed.{{Fn|1}}

==Sources==
*{{Endn|1}}: [[Codex: Adeptus Custodes (9th Edition)]], pg. 33 — ''Solar Watch: Deeds of Legends''

