Lesp.wikitext:
{{TanithPortal}}
'''Lesp''' was a [[Medic|medical orderly]] who served in the [[Tanith First and Only]] under Chief Medical Officer [[Tolin Dorden]].{{Fn|1}}{{Fn|2}}


==Biography==
Back on [[Tanith|his homeworld]], Lesp was a fisherman who lived in [[Tanith Longshore]]. This led him to develop a talent for knife- and needlework before he enlisted with the [[Astra Militarum]], both of which served him well as one of Dorden's orderlies.{{Fn|2}}

In addition to his duties as an orderly and field medic, Lesp was also the foremost artist among the Tanith First when it came to the traditional [[Tanith]] [[tattoo]] markings that many [[Guardsmen]] of the [[Imperial Guard Regiment|regiment]] sported. As a result of his continual exposure to the inks used to draw Tanith tattoos, Lesp's fingertips were permanently stained dark blue.{{Fn|1}}

One of Lesp's most notable accomplishments in the field was saving the life of Trooper [[Murtan Feygor|Feygor]] during the [[Siege of Vervunhive|Third Zoican Storm of Vervunhive]], performing an emergency tracheotomy with his [[Tanith knife]] after Feygor was shot in the throat by a [[Ferrozoica|Zoican]] [[las-round]].{{Fn|3}}

