Leukala Mhal.wikitext:
{{ImperiumPortal}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a Senior [[Arbitrator]] of the [[Adeptus Astartes]]. She commands the Arbites fleet in the [[Calixis Sector]].{{Fn|1}}

Sold into [[Imperial]] indentured servitude at a young age as a volunteer to spare her sisters a similar fate, Leukala ended up in the [[Schola Progenium]] and was recruited into the [[Adeptus Arbites]]. In her early career, she took part in Arbites fleet operations against anti-Imperial guerrillas and [[xenophile]] raiders. Five years after induction she was a commander of a ship of her own, and in ten years she commanded an entire squadron. She was eventually promoted to fleet commander by [[Lord Marshal (Arbites)|Lord Marshal]] [[Goreman]], commanding from the ''[[Radiant Decree]]''.{{Fn|1}}

Mhal is known for her endless energy and unflappable demeanour, which makes her fiercely popular among her men, who simply refer to her as "The Lady".{{Fn|1}}

