Lev Goshen.wikitext:
{{SonsOfHorusPortal}}
'''Lev Goshen''' was the [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] of the [[Sons of Horus]] [[Space Marine Legion|Legion]]'s [[25th Company (Sons of Horus)|25th Company]], during the [[Horus Heresy]].{{Fn|1b}}

He took part in the battles of [[War on Murder|Murder]],{{Fn|4}} [[Battle of Dwell|Dwell]]{{Fn|2}}, and [[Battle of Molech|Molech]]{{Fn|3}}.

Later during the [[Siege of Terra]], Goshen took part in [[Abaddon]]'s subterranean assault underneath the [[Saturnine Gate]]. However the assault had been foreseen by [[Rogal Dorn]], who had [[Arkhan Land]] rapidly fill the breach underneath Saturnine with quick-drying concrete-like material. Goshen's [[Plutona]] burrowing transport broke down as it became entombed. With only a select few of his traitor brothers aware of his location and with his air recycling systems fully operational, Goshen was informed by his [[Tech-Priest]] pilot that they would be eternally buried underneath Saturnine.{{Fn|1a}}

