Levantus.wikitext:
{{UltramarinesPortal}}
'''Levantus''' was a [[Bladeguard Veteran]] in the [[Ultramarines]] [[Chapter]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
He was among the squadron that [[Veteran Sergeant]] [[Metaurus]] led to destroy a relic of the [[Chaos God]] [[Tzeentch]] on [[Zsah'Uj]]. It also included the [[Bladeguard Veteran]] [[Icaron]] and the [[Primaris Lieutenant]] [[Demetrian Titus]], and they deployed together from a [[Strike Cruiser]], that would fire on the relic's location after it was destroyed. The squadron then fought through numerous Tzeentch [[Cultist]]s and [[Tzaangors]] to reach their target, which was a large statue of a [[Lord of Change]]. As they fired at the relic, however, a Tzeentch [[Sorcerer]] attacked the squadron and froze them in place. It then entered the squadron's minds to strike at them and this led to the deaths of Levantus and Icaron, while Metaurus was left severely wounded. Titus, though, was able to break free of the Sorcerer's control, after it entered his mind, and killed the [[Heretic]]. The Lieutenant then provided the Strike Cruiser with the relic's coordinates and pulled Metaurus to safety, before the statue's location was destroyed by the warship.{{Fn|1}}

==Sources==
