Leviticus.wikitext:
{{BlackTemplarsPortal}}
'''Leviticus''' was a [[Black Templars]] [[Marshal (Black Templars)|Marshal]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
Once an [[Emperor's Champion]], Leviticus later became a [[Marshal (Black Templars)|Marshal]] and took part in the [[Third War of Armageddon]]. The fighting there against the invading [[Orks]], caused Leviticus to launch a [[Crusade]] to purge [[Xenos]] species from the [[Galaxy]] and right the wrongs done to the besieged [[Imperial]] [[Armageddon|world]]. This desire to slay Orks, later led the Marshal to take part{{Fn|1}} in the [[Dark Crusade (Imperium)|Dark Crusade]]'s{{Fn|2}} [[Gathrog Campaign]], against the invading [[Green Kroosade]].{{Fn|3}} However, Leviticus would eventually become one of the many [[Imperials]] who were killed by the Orks, during the conflict.{{Fn|1}}
