'''Liminon''' is a [[Grey Knights]] [[Techmarine]] and a member{{Fn|1a}} of [[Epistolary]] [[Graucis Telomane]]'s [[Brotherhood of Thirteen]].{{Fn|1b}}
==History==
The two would meet, after [[Graucis Telomane|Telomane]], [[Geromidas]], [[Epicrane]], [[Lokar (Grey Knights)|Lokar]]  and a number of others aided Liminon in banishing the [[Greater Daemon]] known as the [[Artful Sublime]]. However while Liminon had thought mere hours had passed since the battle began, it had in fact lasted for several centuries, before the other Grey Knights aided him in defeating the Greater Daemon. Besides the loss of much of [[M41]], the Sublime had also caused the loss of Liminon's eyes and prevented from speaking again. The Techmarine now relied on his [[psychic]] powers to speak afterwards and became an ally of Telomane. Liminon became the second most powerful [[psyker]]{{Fn|1a}} in the [[Brotherhood of Thirteen]]{{Fn|1b}} after the [[Epistolary]]. However much of his history remains unknown, as when Telomane searched the Grey Knights' records for information about the Techmarine, scant information was found.{{Fn|1a}}

During their final battle against Angron and the World Eaters aboard the ''[[Conqueror (Ship)|Conqueror]]'', Liminon was slain by [[Autocannon]] fire from [[Chaos Terminator]]s.{{Fn|1c}}


