Liosa.wikitext:
{{EldarPortal}}
'''Liosa''' was a [[Crimson Hunter]] [[Exarch]] of [[Craftworld]] [[Lugganath]].{{Fn|1}}

Liosa took part in Lugganath's attempt to kill the [[Ork]] [[Big Mek]] [[Gorkog Chrometeef]].  In the assault on Chrometeef's new flagship, the ''[[Beastmother]]'', an Ork [[Fighta|fighter plane]] collided with her [[Nightshade Interceptor|interceptor]], killing her.{{Fn|1}}

