Liszt Vandevern.wikitext:
{{OrdoHereticusPortal}}
'''Liszt Vandevern''' is an [[Ordo Hereticus]] [[Inquisitor]] and was a mentor to [[Obodiah Roth]], who once served as Vandevern's [[Interrogator]].{{fn|1}}
==History==
He was a prolific field [[Inquisitor]], who believed a raid would always reap more answers than clinical investigation. Because of this, [[Obodiah Roth]] had fought with half a dozen [[Heretic]] [[Cult]]s, and even besieged the compound of a [[Narcotic|Narco-baron]] on [[Sans Gaviria]] before his 30th year. Sometime later in 866.[[M41]], Roth would go on to become an [[Inquisitor]] himself.{{fn|1}}

