Lithandros-Esmanthil.wikitext:
{{EldarPortal}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' was a [[Farseer]] of the [[Eldar]]. In 452.[[M34]], he was the target of the [[Imperial]] [[Officio Assassinorum]]. Pursued by a dreaded [[Culexus Assassin]], the Eldar sensed the threat but his powers of precognition were useless on the [[Pariah]]. After a long and terrifying hunt through [[Saim-Hann]], the exhausted Farseer gave up and allowed the relentless Assassin to claim him.{{Fn|1}}

