Litz.wikitext:
{{TanithPortal}}
'''Litz''' was a [[Trooper]] of the [[Tanith First and Only]] [[Imperial Guard Regiment|regiment]].{{Fn|1}}

In '''771.[[M41]]''', the Tanith First were deployed on the planet [[Phantine (Planet)|Phantine]] as part of the [[Sabbat Worlds Crusade]]. In the assault on the city of [[Cirenholm]], Litz was blown to pieces by a [[Blood Pact]] [[Chaos Cultist|cultist]] manning a [[plasma cannon]] turret.{{Fn|1}}

