Livy Kolea.wikitext:
{{ImperiumPortal}}
'''Livy Kolea''' was a [[hive]]r who lived on the planet [[Verghast]]. She was married to [[Gol Kolea]] and had two sons - [[Dalin Kolea|Dalin]] and [[Yoncy Kolea|Yoncy]].{{Fn|1}}

When the [[Ferrozoica]]ns lay [[Siege of Vervunhive|siege]] to [[Vervunhive]], Livy was trying to reach a shelter in a transit station. The initial Zoican bombardment shattered the station's ceiling, the glass shards eviscerating Livy and dozens of others; both of her children both survived the blast, however, and were taken in by [[Tona Criid]].{{Fn|1}}

