Lo Chang.wikitext:
{{ImperialFistsPortal}}{{Heretic Tomes}}
'''Lo Chang''' is a [[Chaplain]] of the [[Imperial Fists]]. Lo Chang's face bears crater-like scars from when his helmet failed him in battle. The scars themselves are severe and resemble the craters on the surface of the moon.{{Fn|1a}}

==Character==
Details concerning Lo Chang's rank and [[Space Marine Company|company]] attachment are not explicitly stated, but he appeared beside former [[Chapter Master]] [[Vladimir Pugh|Vladimir Pugh]] and [[First Captain]] [[Darnath Lysander|Lysander]] to administer the oath to the [[Emperor|God-Emperor]] to [[neophyte]] [[Space Marine Scout|Scout]]s, which implies that he is the Chapter's [[Master of Sanctity]].{{Fn|2}} Similarly, he lectures to neophytes on the subjects of [[Rogal Dorn]], [[Age of the Imperium|Imperial History]], and the history and [[Imperial_Fists#Culture|culture]] of the Chapter.{{Fn|1a}}

When preaching, Chaplain Lo Chang is often swept away in ecstasy and is capable of inspiring battle-brothers to ever-greater deeds and to embody true sons of Dorn evermore.{{Fn|3}}

==Quotes==
*"We of the Adeptus Astartes shun genetic deviants, do we not? For the mutant is the melter of Mankind into misshapenness! Whereas we are Mankind Plus, the perfected ideal, are we not?"{{Fn|1b}}

*"Oh Dorn, dawn of our being, be with us, illuminate us."{{Fn|2}}

*"Let Dorn’s light flush away the deathly darkness."{{Fn|1c}}

