Lord of Skin and Sinew.wikitext:
{{KhornePortal}}{{NecromundaPortal}}
The '''Lord of Skin and Sinew''' is an ancient and powerful [[Daemon]] of [[Khorne]], that is worshiped by [[Necromunda (planet)|Necromunda]]'s [[Corpse Grinder Cult]]s.{{Fn|1}} 

The [[Daemon]] is known to have physically appeared within [[Hive Arcos]], when [[Fall of Hive Arcos|it fell to]] the [[Corpse Grinder Cult|Corpse Grinders]], though ancient texts state that this is not the first time the Lord of Skin and Sinew walked on [[Necromunda (planet)|Necromunda]]'s surface. There are various theories about its origins, with some speculating that the Daemon is somehow tied to [[Necromunda (planet)|Necromunda]] and is eternally seeking ways to escape. Others believe, that the Lord of Skin and Sinew is trying to transform the [[Hive World]] into its own personal realm of blood and hunger.{{Fn|1}} 

The Lord of Skin and Sinew is among a number of [[Daemons]], that some in the depths of [[Necromunda (planet)|Necromunda]]'s [[Hive Primus]] sometimes call upon. Those facing death, can desperately beseech it in order to live beyond their allotted life-span and the [[Daemon]] is able to grant that last wish for a price. Those marked by the Lord of Skin and Sinew, however, will be required to conduct [[Human]] sacrifices to the Daemon in order to sustain their lives. In time, though, the powers granted by the Lord of Skin and Sinew will eventually turn its victims into [[Chaos Spawns]].{{Fn|2}}

==Source==
