'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a [[Space Marine Sergeant|Sergeant]] of the [[Blood Angels]].{{Fn|1}} He was one of the survivors in the first encounter of the [[Blood Angels]] with [[Genestealers]], when the xenos took bloody toll from the Blood Angels and only 50 battle-brothers survive in the campaign.{{Fn|2}}

A gifted tactician – after six hundred years of this shameless encounter he led two squads of [[Terminator]]s to board the ''[[Sin of Damnation]]''. Within that legendary [[space hulk]] the Blood Angels erase the shame of their [[Chapter]]’s former defeat, releasing a poison throughout the behemoth that kills the tens of thousands of [[Genestealer]]s slumbering in void-hibernation within its cavernous recesses. In doing so, the Space Marines prevent the vanguard organisms from spreading across the stars, eradicating thousands of potential cults before they have a chance to spawn.{{Fn|1}}

