Loreson Unfleshed.wikitext:
{{IronHandsPortal}}
'''Loreson Unfleshed''' was a [[Clan-Father]] of the [[Iron Hands]] [[Space Marine Legion|Legion]]'s [[Clan Felg]], who survived the [[Dropsite Massacre]] during the [[Horus Heresy]]. After escaping from [[Isstvan V]], he formed a Clan Council along four other surviving Clan-Fathers to lead the Iron Hands in the aftermath of [[Ferrus Manus]]' death.{{Fn|1}}

Loreson Unfleshed was killed along with the rest of the Clan Council in [[Battle of Oqueth Minor|an ambush]] shortly after the formation, leading to [[Shadrak Meduson]] taking over leadership of [[The Shattered Legions]].{{Fn|1}}

