Lotimer Renwyck.wikitext:
{{EcclesiarchyPortal}}
'''Lotimer Renwyck''' was a [[Bishop (Ecclesiarchy)|Bishop]] of the [[Adeptus Ministorum]] active at the dawn of the [[Age of the Dark Imperium]].{{Fn|1}}

==Biography==
Renwyck was the highest representative of the Ecclesiarchy on the [[Mining World]] of [[Ghyre]], having a seat at the world's high conclave as an advisor to [[Planetary Governor]] [[Osmyndri Ellisentris Kallistus]]. He was noted for his humility, wearing a simple hooded cassock rather than expensive, flashy robes and not being attended by bodyguards or scribes, which made him stand out compared to others on the conclave.{{Fn|1}}

He was of the opinion that the troubles which plagued Ghyre following the opening of the [[Great Rift]] were a trial brought upon the planet by [[Emperor of Mankind|The Emperor]] as a test of faith.{{Fn|1}}

