Lsathranil.wikitext:
{{EldarPortal}}
'''Lsathranil''' was an [[Eldar]] [[Farseer]] of [[Ulthanesh Shelwé]] ([[Craftworld]] Ulthwé) over five million years before [[M41]].{{Fn|1}} He wrote the text ''[[Ishandruir]]'', and made [[Lsathranil's Shield]] to contain the [[Necron]]s on the planet [[Rahe's Paradise]].{{Fn|2a}}

==History==
Lsathranil lived well over five million years before [[M41]] as a [[Farseer]] on [[Craftworld]] [[Ulthanesh Shelwé]].{{Fn|1}}

He made the device [[Lsathranil's Shield]] to contain the [[Necrons]] on [[Rahe's Paradise]], and wrote the prophecy ''[[Ishandruir]]'' about their return.{{Fn|2b}}

Using his [[foresight]], Lsathranil knew that the [[Blood Ravens]] [[Chapter]] [[Space Marines]] would be present when the tablet containing the ''[[Ishandruir]]'' was uncovered in [[M41]].{{Fn|2c}} As a result, he sealed away a squadron of [[Wave Serpent]] transports, and [[Falcon]] anti-grav tanks in a cavern on the planet, waiting until they would be discovered by [[Biel-tan]] forces in their time of need soon after the ''Ishandruir'' was uncovered.{{Fn|2a}} He also foresaw and provided for the presence of Biel-tan [[Dark Reaper]]s under [[Exarch]] [[Laeresh]] at this time.{{Fn|2d}}{{Fn|2e}}

