Lucian (Ultramarines).wikitext:
{{UltramarinesPortal}}
'''Lucian''' is an [[Ultramarines]] [[Terminator]], who is a master of battlefield tactics.{{Fn|1b}}

==History==
In battle, he always positions himself where his [[Storm Bolter]]'s firepower can have the greatest effect. Lucian is also accompanied by a relic [[servo-skull]], which records his actions in combat. In [[M42]], Lucian was among the [[Ultramarines]]{{Fn|1b}} that defended the [[Imperium]]'s worlds in the [[Vertex Sector]]. When the vital world of [[Vertex (World)|Vertex]], suffered an [[Ork]] invasion{{Fn|1a}} the Ultramarines{{Fn|1b}} and several [[Space Marine Chapter]]s came to its defence.{{Fn|1a}} Lucian would do battle with the invading Orks{{Fn|1b}}, but his mission changed when the [[Xenos]] found a weakness in the [[Hive City]] of '''Acastus'''' defences. It had been protected during the invasion by a [[Void Shield|Void Shield network]], which was projected from an armoured bunker designated '''Shield Generator Gamma-9'''. However the Orks would discover this and several hordes were sent to destroy it, so the Xenos could invade the Hive City.{{Fn|1a}} 

The [[Chapter]]s became aware of the danger{{Fn|1a}} and each sent a [[Terminator]] to protect the [[Void Shield|Shield Generator]]. Lucian was sent by the [[Ultramarines]] to defend it and he was joined by the [[Blood Angel]] [[Terminator Sergeant|Sergeant]] [[Angelus (Blood Angels)|Angelus]], the [[Imperial Fist]] [[Etrus]], the [[Salamanders|Salamander]] [[Magmus]] and the [[Space Wolf]] [[Stormheart]].{{Fn|1b}} Though they numbered only five, in the close confines of the armoured bunker, these Terminator-armoured warriors would be in their element. None would allow the Orks access to '''Shield Generator Gamma-9''', without a fierce battle.{{Fn|1a}} 

