Lucienne Agamemnus IX.wikitext:
{{ImperiumPortal}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' was the current [[Imperial]] [[Governor]] of [[Vigilus]].

The latest head of the Agamemnus Dynasty which has ruled over Vigilus for millennia, Lucienne is an overconfident pomp noble who was seen as incompetent at best by [[Marneus Calgar]] when the [[Chapter Master]] arrived during the [[War of Beasts]]. He remains on Calgar's war council known as the Vigilus Senate due to his influence over the [[Vigilant Guard]] but has had his supreme authority of the war effort stripped by Calgar. Lucienne's younger brother [[Deinos Agamemnus]] is also a major commander on Vigilus.{{Fn|1}}

When [[Marneus Calgar]] sought to forge an alliance with the [[Eldar]] of [[Saim-Hann]] in order to combat the forces of [[Chaos]] invading Vilus, the deaths of those responsible for the deaths of the [[Autarch]] [[Rhyloor]] was ordered as a condition by the xenos. Faced with the planet's destruction, Calgar had Lucienne Agamemnus IX killed.{{Fn|2}}

