{{ImperiumPortal}}
'''Lucifer Princip''' is a self-proclaimed [[Sensei|son of the Emperor]] who initiated a rebellion upon the world [[Genost]].

Consistent with the background of the Sensei, Princip claims to be immortal. [[Inquisitor]] [[Jaq Draco]] discovered this supposed son of the [[Emperor]] en route to [[Uigebealach]], the point in the [[Webway]] where time flows backwards. When Draco questioned the commanding [[Commissar]] on Princip's background, he stated he was not aware if Genost was his home-world or elsewhere. Jaq then resolves to capture and question Princip.{{Fn|1}} After Jaq's death, the remaining members of Jaq's retinue ([[Imperial Fists]] [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] [[Lexandro D'Arquebus]] and [[Grimm]] the [[Squat]]) resolved to complete Jaq's mission themselves.{{Cite this}}

