Lucius (Blood Ravens).wikitext:
{{BloodRavensPortal}}
'''Lucius''' was a [[Librarian]]-[[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] in the [[Blood Ravens]] [[Chapter]], who led its [[5th Company (Blood Ravens)|Fifth Company]].{{Fn|1}}

In early [[M38]] Lucius and his entire [[Space Marine Company|Company]] disappeared within the massive [[Warp Storm]] known as the [[Maelstrom]] and were later declared lost by the Chapter.  No records of the event still exist, but it is known that the new incarnation of the Fifth Company would become known as '''The Fated''' and its members are made to wear badges of shame and penance to this day; this suggests that something other than an accident befell Lucius and his Company.  Whispered rumours amongst the more puritanical Librarians of the Chapter imply that Lucius led his Company into the Maelstrom on purpose.{{Fn|1}}

