After the corruption of his House by [[Chaos]] at the hands of his [[Psyker]] mother, Luk Tan Chimaeros has sought redemption by hunting the traitor down along with his band of fellow Chimaeros loyalists known as [[Exiles (Freeblade Lance)|The Exiles]]. Luk's forces proved decisive in a number of wars in their defence of the Imperium, most notably against a [[Waaagh!]] during the [[Ork Wars]] on [[Adrastapol]].{{Fn|3}}

