Known within the [[Ultramarines]] for his zealously, Valn has also survived hundreds of battles which have left him now largely composed of [[bionic]]s. However this is just a testament to the [[Chaplain]]'s endurance and righteous fury. These traits saw him survive a last stand on [[Mordent Prime]] and afterwards, Valn fought{{Fn|1}} the [[T'au Empire]]{{Fn|2}} as part of the [[Dark Crusade (Imperium)|Dark Crusade]]'s{{Fn|3}} [[Mont'shi Campaign]].{{Fn|2}} The Chaplain had been charged with stopping the [[Xenos]] attempts to expand their territory,{{Fn|1}} but the Campaign later ended in failure for the Imperium.{{Fn|3}} However Valn, was among the Imperials who survived the Crusade.{{Fn|1}}
