Lutar.wikitext:
{{LOVPortal}}
'''Lutar''' is a [[Leagues of Votann]] [[Hernkyn]] [[Ironkin]] and is a member of the [[Trans-Hyperian Alliance]]'s [[Kindred of the Eternal Starforge]].{{Fn|1}} 
==History==
It is part of the [[hernkyn]] forces commanded by [[Mrytun Dammergot]], who has led them in a freewheeling lifestyle, during the new age of conflict between the [[Leagues of Votann]] and the [[Imperium]]. This came to an end, though, when the [[Hernkendersson Prospect]] [[Kin (Leagues of Votann)|kin]] [[Fyrtor]] sent a message that he had to meet with Dammergot. However, she had deemed that the meeting could wait until after she personally led a boarding attack to disable a [[Tyranid]] [[bioship]] so that it could be harvested. Dammergot left Lutar in charge of their [[hold ship]], the [[Grand Endeavour]]; she was still aboard the bioship when Fyrtor's warship, the [[Canny Wanderer]], reached their location. He then made contact with Lutar, who informed him where Dammergot was. While the [[ironkin]] stated that it would give any message to Dammergot when she returned, Fyrtor refused to provide one. He insisted his message needed to be personally delivered, and so with Lutar's help, Fyrtor boarded the bioship and met with Dammergot. This message put an end to her Hernkyn's freewheeling life, as the [[Trans-Hyperian Alliance|Alliance]]'s [[Hearthspake]] had charged Dammergot with a high stakes mission. Though it was filled with danger, completing the mission would earn the [[Kindred of the Eternal Starforge|Starforge]] a magnificent prize.{{Fn|1}}

