Luthir Veremonn Goreman.wikitext:
{{ImperiumPortal}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a [[Lord Marshal (Arbites)|Lord Marshal]] of the [[Adeptus Arbites]], ruling from the Precinct-Fortress on [[Scintilla]] in the [[Calixis Sector]].{{Fn|1}}

==History==
[[Image:LMGoreman.jpg|thumb|right|240px|Lord Marshal Goreman]]
He was born on the world of [[Sinophia]] to a [[Noble House|noble family]] that specialized in organ trading; as a result the young Goreman learned the art of violence at a young age to secure donors. This changed when he attempted to abduct a former [[Enforcer (Arbites)|Enforcer]] now serving as a [[Confessor]], which quickly resulted in him being converted to the [[Imperial Cult]]. Now a changed man, Goreman helped the [[Adeptus Terra]] round up the militia and supporters of Sinophia's corrupt [[Governor]] after he was found attempting to steal from the [[Administratum]]'s [[Tithe]]. Shortly after, he joined the [[Adeptus Arbites]] as an [[Arbitrator]] recruit.{{Fn|1}}

After putting down a riot on [[Barsapine]], poachers on [[Spectoris]], and a workers' revolt on Scintilla, Goreman rose to command the Scintillan Precinct. He took his seat at a trouble time and feuding and instability plagued his forces. As a result, Goreman oversaw a vicious purge to end the civil fighting within his precinct. Only the intervention of the moderate [[Judge]] [[Jhemek-Naad]] stayed his hand. After gridlock again plagued the Precinct, Goreman was promoted to Lord Marshal.{{Fn|1}}

As commander of Arbites forces in the Calixis Sector, Goreman has overseen the creation of a special task force known as the '''Divisio Immoralis''' which hunts down insurgents and [[cult]]s wherever they may be found.{{Fn|1}}

==Sources==
*{{Endn|1}}: [[Dark Heresy: Book of Judgement]], pgs. 12–14

