Piloting the [[Knight Warden]] ''[[Unalloyed Victory]]'', the suit displays bare [[adamantine]] armour. Luxious earned this armour during fierce fighting against [[Tyranid]]s on the [[Death World]] of [[Tasmadar II]] when the [[Xenos]] ambushed Baron [[Dyrok]]'s lance. During the battle, Luxious unleashed a punishing salvo of fire that ripped one large Tyranid beast attacking the Baron's knight apart. They then engaged in close-range combat with the other creature, sustaining heavy damage before finally bisecting it. Luxious and her Knight then stood guard over their damaged comrades, fighting off waves of subsequent Tyranids until reinforcements arrived.{{Fn|1}}

