'''Lybekion''' is a [[Battle Brother]] of the [[Cruor Blades]] [[Chapter]], who serves in [[Chapter Master]] [[Cyras Vitalion]]'s [[Space Marine Honour Guard Squad|Honor Guard]].{{Fn|1}} 

