Lydda Thurengia.wikitext:
{{ChaosKnightsPortal}}
'''Lydda Thurengia''' is the [[High King|Dam-Regis]] of the [[Chaos Knight|Chaos]] [[Knight House]] [[House Thurengis|Thurengis]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
Her [[Knight House]] and bloodline were once nearly destroyed, when rival groups within [[House Thurengis|Thurengis]] sought to make alliances with offworld groups, to aid their House. One group ultimately chose the [[Iron Warriors]] [[Traitor Legion]] to ally themselves to, while the other chose the [[Dark Mechanicum]] of [[Bhulah IV]]. However they both knew of the other's interest in the House and each began to undermine the other's treaties with the [[Chaos Knights|Knights]] of Thurengis. This led to the deaths of the House's Nobles and eventually a civil war that threatened Thurengis' existence. Before this could happen, though, Thurengia ruthlessly destroyed both of the rival groups within Thurengis. She then executed any participating Nobles that were captured and exiled those that escaped her wrath.{{Fn|1}}

