'''Lydriik Noxyn''' is the current [[Chief Librarian]]{{Fn|1}} and an [[Iron Father]] of the [[Iron Hands]] [[Chapter]].{{Fn|3}} 

Recruited into [[Clan Borrgos]]{{Fn|3}}, Lydriik gained fame for slaying the [[Daemon]] known as the [[Sapphire King]] during the [[Gaudinian Heresy]], and was elevated to [[Iron Father]] after the battle.{{Fn|2a}} During the campaign against the [[Ork]]s on [[Fabris Callivant]], Lydriik uncovered the truth regarding the [[Canticles of Travels]] as well as the [[Mechanicum]] conspiracy surrounding it. During the same battle, he fought [[Craftworld]] [[Alaitoc]]'s forces that were posing as [[Inquisitor]]s, seeking the ancient [[Eldar]] device known as the [[Dawnbreak]].{{Fn|3}}

In battle, he wields the [[Mindforge Stave]].{{Fn|2b}}

