Lynator.wikitext:
{{ImperialFistsPortal}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' was a [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] in the [[Imperial Fists]] [[Chapter]].{{Fn|1}}

Lynator's [[Space Marine Company|Company]] once faced bloody [[Chaos Cult]] uprisings across the [[Mining World]]s of the [[Taurian Belt]]. He sought help to defeat the Cult uprisings and sent a message to [[House Hawkshroud]], which had a reputation for always lending its [[Knight]]s to a battle when asked. To {{PAGENAME}}'s shock, however, Hawkshroud failed to answer his message and this became one of only three times in recorded history the Household did not answer a message for aid.{{Fn|1}}

